## Interface: 120100, 120007
## Title: Postbox
## Notes: A modern, lightweight mailbox replacement — one-pass collection, smart recipients, right-click attach, and it wears your UI.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Postbox\Media\icon-pillar.png
## Author: egsherlock
## Version: @project-version@
## X-License: GPL v3
## X-Website: https://github.com/egsherlock/Postbox
## X-Category: Mail
## SavedVariables: PostboxDB
## OptionalDeps: EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIBlizzardSkin, ElvUI, ElvUI_WindTools

# Foundation layer. Core/Helpers.lua captures Lib\Util.lua's functions by
# reference and Core/Theme.lua binds Lib\UI\Theme.lua at load time, so the whole
# of Lib\ must load before Core\.
Lib\Store.lua
Lib\Events.lua
Lib\Util.lua
Lib\InventoryLock.lua
Lib\UI\Theme.lua
Lib\UI\Window.lua
Lib\UI\Dropdown.lua

# Postbox
Core\Locales.lua
Postbox.lua
Core\Helpers.lua
Core\Recipients.lua
# Reads ns.Recipients (R.Key / R.NormalizeRealm) and ns.Helpers, so it follows
# both; Core\SendTab.lua is its only consumer and loads later still.
Core\MailRules.lua
Core\Theme.lua
Core\MailService.lua
Core\ContactService.lua
Core\CollectTab.lua
Core\SendTab.lua
Core\MailboxUI.lua
Core\MailMemory.lua
Core\MinimapButton.lua
Core\OptionsPanel.lua
Core\RecipientManager.lua

# Optional host-UI skins. Each file is inert unless its host UI is installed.
# EllesmereUI loads last and wins when both are present (see Skin_EllesmereUI.lua).
Core\Skin_ElvUI.lua
Core\Skin_EllesmereUI.lua